{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1000_p", "source_sha256": "61e709bf14fa7f07f55ea0aca55eb9523953030232fe68116681292c1b3d688e", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\nお店を借りて撮影するのだが……環が見当たらない！）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》。\n要借一家店来拍摄，可是……环不见了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b00a6ce2471b94737cc4223adc775d988b2f15096d68f1159649d68d0b8b1ecb", "ja": "お～い、環……！\nそろそろ撮影の時間なのに、どこ行ったんだ？", "zh": "喂——环……！\n都快到拍摄时间了，你跑哪儿去了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "0211f7b650842e7ce66b821fcd4019138aebb733832124e697e4219f857f55e1", "ja": "おっやぶーん！　たまきのこと、呼んだ～？\n困ってるなら、たまきがお助けするぞー！", "zh": "哦——大将！你是在叫小环吗～？\n要是遇到麻烦了，就由小环来帮忙吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1003_p", "source_sha256": "06747837af481a10665ee08437f2ecec4153b879f281a35b3bd91a50a6e41501", "ja": "あっ、環！\nどこに行ってたんだ。探してたんだぞ？", "zh": "啊，环！\n你跑到哪里去了？我一直在找你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "8bd0273e81b7e187d09f5d98ef2321a64f9c32e16018b6f88da22af10f2daa0c", "ja": "あれ？　もしかして、おやぶん困ってない？\nそっか……。", "zh": "咦？难道说，老大遇到麻烦了？\n这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4f05aaa602155444df379cfb272ae43d4eda141004cb804a1279be55be12f866", "ja": "……環？　俺が困ってた方がよかったのか？", "zh": "……环？你希望我遇到麻烦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "efcfa252b695c12ff760475585cb3c4df03e57146b9bcae5094a272d950490eb", "ja": "そうじゃないけど……。たまきも\nかっこいいウェイトレスさんになりたかったから……。", "zh": "不是那样……但环也想成为帅气的女服务生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f4919466283b9518086030dc9292ad804637c639efd3f858d12297c0d5636e40", "ja": "かっこいいウェイトレスさん？", "zh": "帅气的女服务生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "580f6d231b2ce69de2711bfe5cf64c35f77826ea96aa437f9edb5f9a96f914c9", "ja": "うん……。さっきね、\n小さい子がコップを落として割っちゃったんだ。", "zh": "嗯……刚才呀，\n有个小孩子把杯子掉在地上摔碎了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "208384c1f2cb759cbdfe12edbf11f5140b3c2cbeae764a24e57b0d41dcc98a9b", "ja": "そしたら、店員のお姉さんたちがすぐにきて、\nサササーって、きれいに片付けちゃった！　それに……", "zh": "然后，店里的姐姐们马上就过来了，三下五除二地把碎片收拾干净了！而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "619a49c0fa18154f3aaa6af2ae3963c8953e4a7f647fbc6a78e67d1d05bc48ea", "ja": "コップを落としちゃった子もすごい泣いてたけど、\nお姉さんとお話したら、すぐ笑顔になっちゃったんだ！", "zh": "那个打翻杯子的孩子虽然哭得很伤心，但和店里的姐姐聊了几句后，马上就笑起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1011_p", "source_sha256": "df24461963fa9b6774a80c83bceb2f08ac087070934383871d40c8477b95e622", "ja": "おお……。まさにプロの仕事だな。\n環のいうとおり、とってもかっこいいな！", "zh": "哦……真不愧是专业人士。\n就像环说的，真的很帅气啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "b04d13fceb25b947d6e3e6c62b22e4299df21a5e9f324d1f186d6637eca8ebbd", "ja": "でしょ！　だからたまきも、お姉さんたちみたいに\nかっこいいウェイトレスさんになりたかったんだ！", "zh": "对吧！所以环也想像姐姐们一样，成为帅气的女服务生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3c5bed5d8492e22c223388a63a13ddfae6364b83afba3f6554ea73906f5a90e0", "ja": "そういうことか……。かっこいいウェイトレスを目指す\nなら、環はいつもどおりで大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "原来是这样……既然你想成为帅气的女服务生，那环保持平时的样子就没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1014_p", "source_sha256": "36bace525ce837e99ace3a81d534dd6175b0ab5b6bb4137908a05b0641252b20", "ja": "お姉さんたちは、お客さんのことを考えて働いてる……\nアイドルのお仕事と同じだと思わないか？", "zh": "姐姐们工作时都会为客人着想……你不觉得这和偶像的工作是一样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "8e126074ed36a4c7a87b17c673d6b508dc7da4846a04f393c2f7c33097f59a85", "ja": "ほんとだ～！　……そっか。じゃあ、\nたまきは、いつものたまきでいいってことだね♪", "zh": "真的耶～！……这样啊。那就是说，\n环做平时的环就可以了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1016_p", "source_sha256": "37a152b780e7da20f7ca644049af6352faedd4836fb4d878b1ebf1cea6e8aeed", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。……おっと、撮影が始まる時間だな。\n環、頑張って行っておいで！", "zh": "啊，没错。……哎呀，到拍摄开始的时间了。\n小环，加油去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "15b77a42b3eda5fb2911380213396a1751f81458b6b23e44b3a28e350fe702e7", "ja": "うん！　いつものたまきで、いーっぱい頑張る！\nおやぶん、ちゃんと見ててね～♪", "zh": "嗯！我会以平时的环，努力加油的！\n老大，要好好看着我哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0393_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b1d0a05fc1e3a5692bbc834de74d06c8994e8d031dbae4cfa4aac3453b6685eb", "ja": "（自然体な環のおかげで、いい写真が撮れた！　そして\n接客姿が可愛いと、お姉さんたちに人気だった……）", "zh": "（多亏了自然状态下的环，拍到了很棒的照片！而且她接待客人的样子很可爱，深受姐姐们的喜爱……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
